+# Version Scheme
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on its version numbering scheme. A decision record for this topic (`config/decisions/revoke-version-scheme.json`) previously existed in the repository, but it was removed in commit `9881c8a` ("move decision config out of the tree"), which revoked it and took the decision out of the tree. As a result, nothing is currently recorded.
